 158:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_pwr.c ****           (++) HAL_PWR_EnterSTOPMode() with following settings:
 159:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_pwr.c ****               (+++) PWR_MAINREGULATOR_ON to enter STOP0 mode.
