 163:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_pwr.c ****           (++) PWR_STOPENTRY_WFE: enter Stop mode with WFE instruction
 164:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_pwr.c ****       (+) WFI Exit:
